{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22149","headline":"隐几 · 白居易","name":"隐几","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身适忘四支，心适忘是非。\n既适又忘适，不知吾是谁。\n百体如槁木，兀然无所知。\n方寸如死灰，寂然无所思。\n今日复明日，身心忽两遗。\n行年三十九，岁暮日斜时。\n四十心不动，吾今其庶几。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}